{title: Pahile Na Mi Tula}
{artist: Suresh Wadkar}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G] [F] [C],        Pahile na mi tula tu mala na pahile
[D#] [G] [F],        Na kale kadhi kuthe man vede guntale
[G] [F] [G],        Himavarshavatahi kanti tav pahuni ?
[G] [F] [G],        Himavarshavatahi kanti tav pahuni ?
[G] [F] [G],        Taraka nabhatalya lajalya manatuni
[G] [F] [C],        Oghalale himatushar galawar thambale
[D#] [G] [F],        Na kale kadhi kuthe man vede guntale
[G] [F] [G],        Mrudushaiya tochati swapna nave lochani
[G] [F] [G],        Paahiles tu tula arashat jya kshani
[G] [F] [G],        Rupa dekhane baghun nayan he sukhawale
[D#] [G] [F],        Na kale kadhi kuthe man vede guntale
[G] [F] [G],        Ka ugach jhakishi nayan tujhe sajani
[G] [F] [G]
Sangato gupit goshta sparsha tujha chandani
[G] [F] [G]
Dhundalya tujhya mithit deha bhan harapale
[D#] [G] [F],        Na kale kadhi kuthe man vede guntale
